    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Number 2 Harbour View is a three bedroom aparment in turnkey apartment in the heart of Clifden Town. \r\n\r\nAccomodation spans over one story, with a total floor area of circa 89.08 square meters, the property is bright and spacious throughout. There is a large open plan kitchen and living room with a solid fuel open fire, for cosy winter evenings. From the sitting room there is a sliding door leading directly out onto a large patio area that looks out over the Atlantic Ocean. There are three large double bedrooms-one of which has its own access to the large patio. There are also two bathrooms-one a shower room and one bath. The apartment is very stylish and well presented, with great attention to detail to the fixtures and finishings throughout. Some of the carefully chosen furniture is included in the sale.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is serviced both by stairs and elevator and although one is right in the middle of town, it is quiet and peaceful. There is also an underground carpark for off street parking.\r\n\r\nNumber Harbour View provides all the creature comforts of apartment living, whilst enjoying a superb location to enjoy the amenities and facilities that Clifden has to offer.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nContact our office today to arrange a viewing!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer on All Listings\r\nThese particulars are intended to give a fair description of the property only and are in no way guaranteed, nor do they form part of any contract. They are issued on the express condition that all negotiations are conducted through Matt O’Sullivan Ltd. All properties are offered subject to contract and to being unsold."
      },
